      "i_understand_the_tradeoff_explain_in_o": "मैं संतुलन समझता/समझती हूँ — अपने शब्दों में समझाएँ",
      "explain_in_your_own_words_how_do_wpm_a": "अपने शब्दों में समझाएँ: WPM, सटीकता और गति-वेग आपस में कैसे जुड़ते हैं? टाइपिंग अभ्यास के लिए Pareto सीमा का क्या अर्थ है?",
      "design_note_discrete_5_zone_marker_par": "डिज़ाइन टिप्पणी: 5 अलग-अलग क्षेत्र-चिह्न; Pareto वक्र संतुलन-क्षेत्र दिखाता है; कोई \"सही\" लक्ष्य नहीं — यह जानबूझकर है।",
      "bottom-row_description": "Reach down to z x c v b n m",
      "calming_description": "Seven self-regulation passages a student can type — and read aloud — when feelings get big. Includes box-breathing language, the 5-4-3-2-1 grounding technique, the \"feelings are waves\" frame, the \"pause is not giving up\" reframe, and the \"anxiety lies\" CBT script. Designed by school-psych guidance; not a substitute for clinical care, but a typing-rhythm anchor a student can use in the moment.",
      "capitalization_description": "Shift-key practice. Capitals at sentence starts and proper nouns.",
      "common-words_description": "High-frequency words build real reading fluency.",
      "custom_description": "Your teacher or you can enter any text — spelling lists, IEP goals, science vocab. Not scored for mastery.",
      "focus-errors_description": "Auto-generated practice for YOUR top error keys. Updates after every session based on the heatmap.",
      "growth-mindset_description": "Seven passages on effort, struggle, and the small word YET. Built on Carol Dweck's growth-mindset research and current brain-plasticity science. Pairs with Mind & Body Calming (regulate) and Self-Advocacy (speak up) to form a complete SEL arc — regulate, reframe, advocate. K through high school.",
      "home-row_description": "Start here. Fingers rest on a, s, d, f · j, k, l, ;",
      "maine_description": "Seven hand-written passages about Maine — lighthouses, lobstering, Mount Katahdin, the Penobscot River, Wabanaki history, blueberry barrens, Portland fog. One per grade band, K through high school.",
