      "first_90_desc": "6 sections (Watkins framework): overview + 5-stage approach, first week priorities, first month focus, days 31-60, days 61-90, common mistakes. The trajectory of your tenure is set in the first 90 days.",
      "five_dimension_rubric_for_grading_stud": "Five-dimension rubric for grading student work on assignments using this tool. Each dimension scored 1-4 (Beginning, Developing, Proficient, Excellent). Customize by weighting dimensions for your course emphasis.",
