      "eight_abdominal_glands_on_workers_aged": "Eight abdominal glands on workers aged 12–18 days secrete liquid wax that hardens into flakes. Bees chew and shape flakes into hexagonal cells — the most space-efficient shape in geometry (proven by the Honeycomb Conjecture).",
