      "hide_reference_tabs": "Hide reference tabs",
      "high_embodied_carbon_per_kg_difficult_": "High embodied carbon per kg + difficult end-of-life. But weight savings can reduce total material. Best for retrofits + specialty applications, not yet competitive for primary structure.",
      "high_seismic_zones": "High-seismic zones",
