      "dawn_dusk_crepuscular_hours_are_when_m": "Dawn + dusk (crepuscular hours) are when many cephalopods become active. Octopus species vary: common octopus is nocturnal in much of its range; Caribbean reef octopus is strictly nocturnal; day octopus (Octopus cyanea) hunts at midday.",
