      "good_shepherd_food_bank_auburn_is_main": "Good Shepherd Food Bank (Auburn) is Maine's largest hunger-relief organization, distributing food through ~600 pantries and meal programs statewide. Other Maine food resources: Wayside Food Programs (Portland), Preble Street, Locker Project (school-based pantries), and a strong network of regional food hubs.",
