      "explosive_because_luther_is_saying_not": "Explosive because Luther is saying not only that the indulgence-buyers are mistaken — but that they AND the priests selling indulgences will be damned. It directly attacks the religious authority of clergy who profit from the practice. This is the kind of language that turned an academic dispute into a movement that authorities could not easily suppress.",
