      "you_set_the_type_for_a_200_page_latin_": "You set the type for a 200-page Latin grammar. After the first 50 pages are printed, you discover a typo on page 38 — \"amat\" should be \"amet.\" Reprinting 50 pages costs the master 2 florins in paper + 2 days of labor. The error is small (a tense difference) + might be missed in proofing.",
