      "earn_while_you_learn_registered_appren": "Earn while you learn. Registered apprenticeships at unions (Iron Workers Local 7), at shops (Cianbro, BIW), or via Maine Apprenticeship Program (state-registered). Paid wages from day one, escalating as you certify.",
